OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist dies after crash with
OL,4,Acar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has died following a
OL,7,Fcrash with a car.
OL,9,FThe collision, involving a grey Honda
OL,10,Fmotorbike and a grey Skoda, happened at
OL,11,Fthe junction of Windsor Road and
OL,12,FFifield Road, near Maidenhead,
OL,13,FBerkshire, shortly before 18:00 GMT on
OL,14,FSaturday, Thames Valley Police said.
OL,16,FThe rider of the bike, a man in his
OL,17,F20s, was taken to hospital in a
OL,18,Fcritical condition but died of his
OL,19,Finjuries on Sunday. A man aged in his
OL,20,F70s, who was driving the Skoda, was not
OL,21,Finjured.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
